### PatchAsync(Uri, HttpContent)                          ----    PatchAsync_UpdateIssueAsync     state:open, closed, state_reason:not_planned, duplicate, reopened
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/patchasync/repos/{{owner}}/{{repo}}/issues/update HTTP/2
Accept : application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "issue_number": "1",
  "state": "open",
  "state_reason": "not_planned",
  "labels": [
    "bug"
  ]  
}


